<%# Sent after the fact: the rooms are already back on sale. It states what
    happened without assigning blame, and ends with a way forward -- an agent who
    did send payment needs a route back, not an accusation. %>
<%= render "notification_mailer/agent_payment_notice",
      accent: "#b42318",
      eyebrow: "Booking cancelled",
      headline: "These rooms have been released",
      body: "We did not receive payment for this booking by its deadline, so it has been cancelled and the rooms returned to sale. If you still need them, you can search again in the portal, subject to availability. If you have already sent payment, please contact the hotel and they will sort it out with you." %>
